# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sentinel Workspace — curated seed repo
#
# This repo is NOT a dump of the local workspace. modules/ and
# projects/ are allowlisted below: everything under them is ignored
# by default, and only blessed, shippable/example content is tracked.
# To add a new module/project: add a matching `!` line here (or use
# `git add -f <path>`). Experiments stay local and untracked.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Generated / local artifacts ──────────────────────────────
captures/
**/captures/
*.previous
projects/recovery_*.sentinel
*.log
# compiled shader caches (regenerated on load; build/GPU-specific)
**/shader_cache/

# ── Curated module library ───────────────────────────────────
# Ignore all modules, then re-include the shipped ones.
modules/*
!modules/_shared/
# topographic_hud module set (15)
!modules/field_gen/
!modules/contour_blue/
!modules/contour_accent/
!modules/grid_warp/
!modules/node_gen/
!modules/node_render/
!modules/link_gen/
!modules/link_render/
!modules/label_gen/
!modules/label_render/
!modules/frame_hud/
!modules/atmosphere/
!modules/compositor/
!modules/post/
!modules/signal/

# ── Curated projects ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Ignore all projects, then re-include the shipped ones.
projects/*
!projects/topographic_hud/
